                                                "sense_id": "18bbfc48-c367-3f27-970e-34c803580ecc",
                                                "text": "It is proposed also to provide two Regional stores, one at Doncaster and one at Stratford, to supply outstations and the main works with diesel locomotive spares."
                                            }
