                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db106bab-1e26-482b-9488-20206d3bb425",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0ea1be1-367a-3cae-99bb-76937c1bb20a",
                        "source_sense_id": "417dfe5c-580c-336c-8d81-cf7033f9f35b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Standort fern vom Zentrum",
                        "target_lang_word": "outpost",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "outpost",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f6722ee-b311-3ffc-a7c1-0619dd98cf09",
                                        "entry_id": "ff5e4005-f260-3bb2-a47c-09e420bdaba6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A military post stationed at a distance from the main body of troops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49849c02-7e09-424b-9c3f-b7032b3483f4",
                                                "sense_id": "3f6722ee-b311-3ffc-a7c1-0619dd98cf09",
                                                "text": "The outpost did not have enough ammunition to resist a determined assault."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f042d053-cd7f-3bc1-b127-75daffdd94e7",
                                        "entry_id": "ff5e4005-f260-3bb2-a47c-09e420bdaba6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The body of troops manning such a post."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db477e63-f9aa-4b7d-966c-86e130cc7f6d",
                                                "sense_id": "f042d053-cd7f-3bc1-b127-75daffdd94e7",
                                                "text": "Sgt. Smith fleeced most of the rest of the outpost of their earnings in their weekly game of craps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a0bbf21-e5c5-3e31-acf2-7686ac532e17",
                                        "entry_id": "ff5e4005-f260-3bb2-a47c-09e420bdaba6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An outlying settlement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50c47364-4311-4d65-a15c-fe94f490e35a",
                                                "sense_id": "1a0bbf21-e5c5-3e31-acf2-7686ac532e17",
                                                "text": "Beyond the border proper, there are three small outposts not officially under government protection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ba812f5-c3e1-4ccd-9d1f-1c3718e5ed6b",
                                                "sense_id": "1a0bbf21-e5c5-3e31-acf2-7686ac532e17",
                                                "text": "On March 9, 1903, an extension, 50 miles in length, was opened from Letterkenny to the remote outpost of Burtonport, a small township on the shores of the Atlantic in the far north-west corner of Co. Donegal, running through some of the wildest and bleakest parts of the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78fea91e-23d8-4ca1-a9fc-db23847005fa",
                                                "sense_id": "1a0bbf21-e5c5-3e31-acf2-7686ac532e17",
                                                "text": "[…] Colonel Moen was trying to make sense of the radio nets, which had never really been operational let alone secure; our numerous outposts were cobbled together with hand-held Motorolas and too few repeater stations […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c4eeb3f-e9fb-4618-974b-ab905f7e61f6",
                                                "sense_id": "1a0bbf21-e5c5-3e31-acf2-7686ac532e17",
                                                "text": "Francis, by contrast, was at pains to listen and act, going so far in 2023 as to call a curiously named synod on synodality in his anxiety to make the process work better as a conduit between the centre and the outposts of his global church."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff13f06d-d1f5-3002-a3e6-e5adab7668ca",
                                        "entry_id": "ff5e4005-f260-3bb2-a47c-09e420bdaba6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A square protected by a pawn that is in or near the enemy's stronghold."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bba864b3-d2a0-4c17-a358-477b9fa9da5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0ea1be1-367a-3cae-99bb-76937c1bb20a",
                        "source_sense_id": "417dfe5c-580c-336c-8d81-cf7033f9f35b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Standort fern vom Zentrum",
                        "target_lang_word": "avant-poste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "avant-poste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                        "entry_id": "f58f5c6b-4bfb-3371-afac-07c303433c28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Élément armé placé en avant du gros des troupes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67bcfae4-d456-4ed8-8dc3-78e216204588",
                                                "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                                "text": "Le 31 au matin les avant-postes Cosaques signalèrent l'approche des rebelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96edc6bd-da87-452e-9d3f-3ecbf2bcbadc",
                                                "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                                "text": "On s’abouche avec la sentinelle, puis on parlemente successivement avec la grand’garde, l’avant-poste, le poste, le contre-poste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4428177b-fb9e-4a2b-9949-715a9c6a1577",
                                                "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                                "text": "Le gardien lui avait ouvert, quand il s'était présenté en brandissant la bouteille d’eau-de-vie, comme un parlementaire arbore un drapeau blanc aux avant-postes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "042ae358-19eb-4b48-973a-a10b0b6c458d",
                                                "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                                "text": "Gabriel Morange se retrouva aux avant-postes, tenant son fusil à deux mains, ahanant comme un beau diable. Son voisin de droite, un Turc complètement défoncé au haschich, maugréait des choses inaudibles dans son épaisse moustache. Morange crut toutefois comprendre qu’il en avait autant après ceux d’en face qu’après son propre état-major qui les envoyait sans vergogne au casse-pipe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb925414-9b0d-4951-b7f4-c19dd5c1a343",
                                                "sense_id": "6ad1512a-b875-3d49-88ee-3c8da879561f",
                                                "text": "Nos avant-postes de recherches sont complètement souterrains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5af774d7-e150-316b-ac87-184d495294cf",
                                        "entry_id": "f58f5c6b-4bfb-3371-afac-07c303433c28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Position de pointe, en avance sur les autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e4122b8-6267-4cf2-83c9-1fa596eec9bd",
                                                "sense_id": "5af774d7-e150-316b-ac87-184d495294cf",
                                                "text": "L'année suivante, une autre « friterie » était créée à Lorient, et en 1828 Douarnenez voyait s'ouvrir sa première conserverie. Très rapidement les « friteries » de sardines se multiplièrent sur toute la côte, de Pornic à Camaret, avec quelques avant-postes sur les côtes de la Manche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3a2c2ac-314f-45d0-91f9-bab6e09dfce9",
                                                "sense_id": "5af774d7-e150-316b-ac87-184d495294cf",
                                                "text": "S’il faut croire ce que l’on raconte, ce patelin est un avant-poste de l’enfer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98f29d0a-d1cb-425e-b3cf-0269f1938257",
                                                "sense_id": "5af774d7-e150-316b-ac87-184d495294cf",
                                                "text": "Google, par exemple, est aux avant-postes d’une économie de l’infini : des plateformes éducatives, la cartographie 3D, les habitats connectés, le marché de la santé, les voitures sans pilote…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
